Hitler cryogenic freezing so he could awaken with Germany taking over the world. Hitler excitedly accepted, but they only ended up killing him. Hitler is sent to Hell and transformed into a powerful beast, just like in his past life. He wants to expel all the demons from the Earth because he hates them, but Lucifer can do nothing and, on the contrary, enjoys what Hitler is doing. Meanwhile, millions of demons emerge and global conflicts escalate to levels dangerous for human survival. Knowing this, Shootman will have to travel between portals to finish off Hitler once and for all and take the Axis powers (Japan, Italy, and the former Palestine) to hell with him, while Hitler's existence comes to an end.", "summary": "A game of dark humor and political and social satire. Crude and realistic references in a 3D first-person shooter. Prepare to see some very strange things in this strange game. LET'S KILL THE NAZIS TOGETHER!", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/brutal-war"}